  "notes": "A traditional Welsh carol, free for anyone to play. Each line is \"Deck the halls\" on G, a quick D on \"holly\", then C to G and D to G for the \"fa la la\"s. The third line moves away: D, then G and D, Em and A, back to D. The last line is the same as the first. Some chords only get one or two beats, so look ahead at NEXT."
